{
  "_note": "OpenCode Go（$10/月）实测配置（2026-10-24）。可用端点：https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1（OpenAI chat/completions），必须带 x-opencode-session header，否则 400 MissingSessionID。已实测：deepseek-v4.1-flash / kimi-k3 / longcat-2.0 / glm-5.3-flash / qwen3.8-flash 可用；claude-haiku-5-5、gpt-6-luna 等报 ModelProtocolUnsupported（走 responses/anthropic 协议）；qwen3.8-max 作 judge 时单次可 >60s 甚至卡住，不建议；deepseek-v4-pro 测试时 503。⚠️ Go 条款写明面向编码 agent 流量并监控滥用，请自行判断研究用途风险。",
  "models": [
    {
      "name": "go-deepseek-v4.1-flash",
      "provider": "openai",
      "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash",
      "base_url": "https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1",
      "api_key_env": "OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY",
      "temperature": 0.3,
      "max_tokens": 2000,
      "timeout": 180,
      "extra_headers": {"x-opencode-session": "guide-eval"},
      "roles": ["candidate"]
    },
    {
